# The files the corpus's cases name by URL and the resolver of the conformance runner serves (the library fetches nothing, ever).
#
# One record per line: <url> TAB <sha256> TAB <bytes> TAB <file>. fetch.sh downloads each into third_party/resvg-remote/<file> and refuses a
# copy whose SHA-256 differs from the pin; score.py checks every file against its pin before the runner starts and fails the run when one is
# missing or differs, so that a case judged against a moved file cannot be scored. A changed pin is a reviewed change: the cases that name the
# URL (structure/image/url-to-png, structure/image/url-to-svg) are re-scored with it.
#
# The two files are Wikimedia Commons' PNG transparency demonstration (800 x 600 RGBA) and its SVG logo, as served on 2026-11-17.
